<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head><script src="s/header.js"></script></head>
<body>
<script> titleOut("false", "");</script>
<script>
    function bt_submit_onclick() {
        document.getElementById("txt").value = $("#content").html();
        document.form1.submit();
    }
</script>
<div class="wrap">
    <form name="form1" action="./" method="post">
        <div class="content" id="top">
            
            <div class="tips" id="tip">在下方的编辑框内，您可以粘贴（或者手动输入）您需要暂存的内容，点击“提交”后。本站会生成一个很短的链接地址来暂存您的内容。</div>
        </div>
        <div class="test_box" id="content" contenteditable="true"></div>
        <input type=hidden id="txt" name="txt">
        <input class="btn page-btn" type="button" value="提交" onClick="bt_submit_onclick()"><br>
    </form>
</div>
</body>

</html>
